# Data files
/data/
*.db
*.mbox

# ...except the synthetic test fixture. The blanket *.mbox rule above exists so
# a real Takeout export can never be committed by accident; this one holds
# invented correspondents only, and the end-to-end test cannot run without it.
!tests/fixtures/*.mbox

